## Integration Testing Strategy

- Test complete user flows
- Verify end-to-end scenarios thoroughly
- Use real device testing
- Cover critical paths first
- Test navigation flows completely
- Verify data persistence accurately
- Validate external service integration

## Integration Test Structure

- Use `integration_test` package exclusively
- Test on real devices
- Separate from unit tests
- Focus on user journeys
- Test critical business flows
- Validate system integration points
- Use test helpers @integration_test/helpers/

```dart
// Integration test example from project
import 'package:flutter/services.dart';
import 'package:flutter_test/flutter_test.dart';
import 'package:integration_test/integration_test.dart';
import 'package:monica_companion/main.dart' as app;

void main() {
  IntegrationTestWidgetsFlutterBinding.ensureInitialized();

  group('App Integration Tests', () {
    testWidgets('should complete full user flow', (tester) async {
      // Arrange
      app.main();
      await tester.pumpAndSettle();

      // Act & Assert - Complete user journey
      await _navigateToContacts(tester);
      await _createNewContact(tester);
      await _verifyContactCreated(tester);
    });
  });
}
```

