## Device Testing Requirements

- Test on multiple devices
- Validate different screen sizes
- Test on various OS versions
- Verify performance on devices
- Test network connectivity scenarios
- Validate platform-specific features
- Test accessibility on devices

```dart
// Device-specific testing patterns
testWidgets('should work on tablet devices', (tester) async {
  // Simulate tablet screen size
  await tester.binding.setSurfaceSize(Size(1024, 768));

  app.main();
  await tester.pumpAndSettle();

  // Test tablet-specific layouts
  expect(find.byType(NavigationRail), findsOneWidget);
});
```

