## API Integration Testing

- Mock external API responses
- Test network error scenarios
- Verify data synchronization
- Test authentication flows
- Validate API contract compliance
- Test timeout handling
- Verify retry mechanisms

```dart
// API integration testing with mocks
testWidgets('should handle API failures gracefully', (tester) async {
  // Arrange - Setup mock API responses
  when(() => mockApiService.getContacts())
      .thenThrow(NetworkException('Connection failed'));

  app.main();
  await tester.pumpAndSettle();

  // Act - Trigger API call
  await tester.tap(find.byKey(Key('refresh_button')));
  await tester.pumpAndSettle();

  // Assert - Verify error handling
  expect(find.text('Connection failed'), findsOneWidget);
  expect(find.byType(RetryButton), findsOneWidget);
});
```

