## Test Data Management

- Use consistent test fixtures
- Isolate test data creation
- Clean up test data
- Use realistic test scenarios
- Manage test database state
- Avoid data dependencies
- Use test-specific configurations

```dart
// Test data management patterns
class IntegrationTestHelpers {
  static Future<void> setupTestData() async {
    await DatabaseService.instance.clearAllTables();
    await _seedTestContacts();
    await _setupTestConfiguration();
  }

  static Future<void> cleanupTestData() async {
    await DatabaseService.instance.clearAllTables();
    await _resetConfiguration();
  }
}
```

