## Test Environment Setup

- Use separate test configurations
- Configure test database instances
- Setup mock external services
- Use test-specific environment variables
- Configure test logging levels
- Setup test data generators
- Use isolated test environments

```dart
// Test environment configuration
void main() {
  IntegrationTestWidgetsFlutterBinding.ensureInitialized();

  setUpAll(() async {
    await IntegrationTestHelpers.setupTestEnvironment();
  });

  tearDownAll(() async {
    await IntegrationTestHelpers.cleanupTestEnvironment();
  });
}
```

